        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Combine the logarithms: $\\log_{5}[(x - 2)(x + 2)] = 1$.<br>This implies $(x - 2)(x + 2) = 5^1 = 5$.<br>Simplify: $x^2 - 4 = 5 \\Rightarrow x^2 = 9 \\Rightarrow x = \\pm 3$.<br>Since $x - 2 > 0$, $x = 3$.</p>",
