        "question_type": "Objective",
        "exam_year": "2011",
        "question_text": "<p>Find the coefficient of $x^3$ in the expansion of $(2x - 3)^5$.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Use the binomial expansion formula: $(a + b)^n = \\sum_{k=0}^{n} \\binom{n}{k} a^{n-k} b^k$.<br>Here, $a = 2x$, $b = -3$, and $n = 5$.<br>The term containing $x^3$ is $\\binom{5}{2} (2x)^3 (-3)^2 = 10 \\cdot 8x^3 \\cdot 9 = 720x^3$.<br>The coefficient is $720$.</p>",
